<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Narwal - 60,000 tonnes NSW/Brazil 25-30/9 $9.50 fio 25,000 shinc/9,000 shinc Marifran.</p>
<p>ORE - Alina - 120,000 tonnes Tuburao/Shanghai early Oct $9.50 fio scale load/10,000 shinc Eastern Rich.</p>
<p>Viva - 100,000 tonnes Narvik/Rotterdam 1-10/10 $2.75 fio six days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>There were no new fixtures reported from New York on Friday.</p>
</text>
